{"4726800": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Earth’s Last Defense Idle Fleet", "steam_appid": 4726800, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earth's Last Defense is an idle fleet-command defense game about holding the line against an alien hive invasion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with Earth, your hero ship, a fighter, and a mining ship. As the battle runs in real time, your fleet earns resources, destroys enemies, unlocks new ships, and grows into a full defensive armada. Every wave pushes harder, every upgrade matters, and every run helps build a stronger command force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and upgrade your fleet:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Fighters, mining ships, repair drones, corvettes, and heavier warships</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Hero ships with progression and combat upgrades</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Turrets, modules, skill trees, and permanent research</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Resource systems built for long-term idle progression</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is designed around passive progression, but your choices still matter. Pick upgrades, expand your shipyard, manage your fleet limits, improve Earth's defenses, and prepare for stronger enemy waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the hive gets too strong, rebuild smarter. Earn power over time, unlock deeper systems, and push farther into the invasion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earth is not saved in one run. It is defended one wave at a time.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earth's Last Defense is an idle fleet-command defense game about holding the line against an alien hive invasion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with Earth, your hero ship, a fighter, and a mining ship. As the battle runs in real time, your fleet earns resources, destroys enemies, unlocks new ships, and grows into a full defensive armada. Every wave pushes harder, every upgrade matters, and every run helps build a stronger command force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and upgrade your fleet:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Fighters, mining ships, repair drones, corvettes, and heavier warships</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Hero ships with progression and combat upgrades</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Turrets, modules, skill trees, and permanent research</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Resource systems built for long-term idle progression</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is designed around passive progression, but your choices still matter. Pick upgrades, expand your shipyard, manage your fleet limits, improve Earth's defenses, and prepare for stronger enemy waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the hive gets too strong, rebuild smarter. Earn power over time, unlock deeper systems, and push farther into the invasion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earth is not saved in one run. It is defended one wave at a time.</p>", "short_description": "Command Earth’s last fleet in an idle space-defense game where every wave, kill, upgrade, ship, and module pushes your defense further. Build fighters, drones, corvettes, heroes, turrets, and permanent upgrades as the alien hive grows stronger.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4726800/b69c5aa85668c11d26ea6640ed545bcd59766cee/header.jpg?t=1786707523", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4726800/5da3e9587937d2768f1c2707ea42991047d47693/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786707523", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4726800/5da3e9587937d2768f1c2707ea42991047d47693/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786707523", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system